co-funding + investment</b> (the report's model: brands finance the sensor =
network that produces their category read). This is the #1 cash-flow risk =
=E2=80=94 the revenue chart assumes the same sensor curve still gets deploy=
ed.</li>
      <li><b>Retailer becomes a rev-share partner, not a customer.</b> ~28%=
 of data revenue goes to the retailer (better than NIQ's ~300 CZK/store/mo)=
